/* harmony default export */ __webpack_exports__["default"] = ("<div id=\"cognism-wrapper\" class=\"angular-page-wrapper-props ld-body-medium\">\n  <ld-breadcrumbs [breadcrumbs]=\"breadcrumbs\"></ld-breadcrumbs>\n\n\n  <div class=\"ld-header\">Integrations</div>\n\n  <div class=\"partner-config-header-section with-separator\">\n    <div class=\"cognism-icon partner-icon-prop\"></div>\n    <div class=\"partner-config-header-description-wrapper ld-body-large\">\n      <div class=\"ld-subheader\">\n        {{ partnerLabel }}\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"ld-body-large\">\n        {{ summary }}\n      </div>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n  \n  <div class=\"partner-config-body-section\">\n    <div class=\"partner-instructions-section\">\n      <div class=\"ld-section-header get-started-header\">\n        Recommended for:\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"ld-body-large get-started-description extra-margin\">\n        <ul>\n          <li>Leads with minimal information</li>\n          <li>Sales teams with territories setup based on company size, revenue, or other firmographics</li>\n          <li>Sales teams who are manually checking multiple systems to ensure leads have accurate data</li>\n        </ul>\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"ld-section-header instructions-header\">\n        Plays:\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"instruction-wrapper extra-margin\">\n        <div class=\"ld-body-large instructions-content\">\n          <ol>\n            <li>Enable speed-to-lead by activating routing as soon as enrichment is completed via Cognism's Live Refresh</li>\n            <li>Leverage enrichment data to drive routing accuracy and context via Cognism's Web Application</li>\n          </ol>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"instruction-wrapper\">\n        <div class=\"ld-section-header instructions-subheader\">\n          Play #1\n        </div>\n        <div class=\"ld-section-header instructions-subheader\">Enable speed-to-lead by activating routing as soon as enrichment is completed via Cognism's Live Refresh</div>\n        <div class=\"ld-body-large italic instructions-subheader\">\n          Implementation Steps [Lead and Contact Routing]\n        </div>\n        <div class=\"ld-body-large instructions-content\">\n          <ol>\n            <li>In Cognism, ensure your Cognism data is set up to sync to Salesforce. Turn on Live Refresh for Lead/Contact. For more information, see <a href=\"https://help.cognism.com/hc/en-gb/articles/4407455139602-How-to-Integrate-Cognism-to-Salesforce-\" target=\"_blank\">here</a>.</li>\n            <li>In LeanData Lead/Contact FlowBuilder, trigger Routing by configuring the Cognism Updated Enrich Trigger for Cognism enriched Leads.</li>\n            <ol type=\"a\">\n              <li>Use the suggested condition to only include records where the 'Needs to be Synced with Cognism' checkbox is set to false.</li>\n              <li>Configure additional fields &amp; rules as desired to restrict to a subset of Cognism enriched records.</li>\n            </ol>\n            <li>Connect the trigger edge(s) to your existing graph path where the lead is routed to the appropriate sales team member based on your sales strategy.</li>\n            <li>Eliminate any Hold Until or Time-Based node wait steps where the Lead was held to allow enrichment to complete.</li>\n            <li>Watch as rep response times increase!</li>\n          </ol>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"instruction-wrapper\">\n        <div class=\"ld-section-header instructions-subheader\">\n          Play #2\n        </div>\n        <div class=\"ld-section-header instructions-subheader\">Leverage enrichment data to drive routing accuracy and context via Cognism Web Application</div>\n        <div class=\"ld-body-large italic instructions-subheader\">\n          Implementation Steps [Lead and Contact Routing]\n        </div>\n        <div class=\"ld-body-large instructions-content\">\n          <ol>\n            <li>In the Cognism Web Application, ensure your Cognism data is set up to sync to Salesforce.</li>\n            <ol type=\"a\">\n              <li>Set up Salesforce Integration field mappings in Settings > Integrations > Salesforce > Settings Cog (next to Log Out).</li>\n              <li>Within Lead or Contact tabs, ensure that the field mapping is set for 'Last Updated Date' Cognism field and set the update rule as 'Always Overwrite'. For more information, see <a href=\"https://help.cognism.com/hc/en-gb/articles/4407455457426-Setting-Up-Salesforce-Integration-Field-Mappings-\" target=\"_blank\">here</a>.</li>\n            </ol>\n            <li>In LeanData Lead/Contact FlowBuilder, configure the Cognism New Enrich Trigger Node for records exported to Salesforce from the Cognism Web Application.</li>\n            <ol type=\"a\">\n              <li>Use the field mapped in step 1 as the condition to include records.  The condition determines when the 'Last Updated Date' Cognism field is updated.</li>\n              <li>Configure additional fields &amp; rules as desired to restrict the node to a subset of the Cognism enriched records.</li>\n            </ol>\n            <li>Connect the trigger edge(s) to your existing graph path where the Lead is routed to the appropriate sales team member based on your sales strategy.</li>\n            <li>Eliminate any Hold Until or Time-Based node wait steps where the lead was held to allow enrichment to complete.</li>\n            <li>Watch as rep response times increase!</li>\n          </ol>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n</div>\n");

