//api.slack.com</a>\n            </li>\n            <li>Follow the instructions in\n              <a href=\"https://leandatahelp.zendesk.com/hc/en-us/articles/360022644254-Routing-LeanData-Slack-FlowBuilder-Integration\"\n                target=\"_blank\">our Implementation Guide</a>\n              to create an App and install the App in your workspace.\n            </li>\n          </ol>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"instruction-wrapper\">\n        <div class=\"ld-body-large-bold instructions-subheader\">In LeanData: </div>\n        <div class=\"ld-body-large instructions-content\">\n          <ol>\n            <li>Once you've created and installed the App, paste the Bot User OAuth Access Token into the \"Bot User\n              OAuth Access Token\" field.</li>\n            <li>\n              <div>\n                To send {{ partnerLabel }} notifications to public and private channels, check the \"Send {{ partnerLabel }} \n                notifications to both public and private channels\" box located to the right and <b>invite the App to the private channels.</b>\n              </div>\n              <ol type=\"a\">\n                <li>If you do not invite the App, the private Channel will not be selectable in FlowBuilder.</li>\n              </ol>\n            </li>\n            <li>Save your settings by clicking \"Authorize {{ partnerLabel }}.\"</li>\n          </ol>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"instruction-wrapper\">\n        <div class=\"ld-body-large\">\n          <em>To fully understand and leverage the capabilities of the {{ partnerLabel }}-LeanData integration, please\n          review the implementation documentation\n          <a href=\"https://leandatahelp.zendesk.com/hc/en-us/articles/360022644254-Routing-LeanData-Slack-FlowBuilder-Integration\"\n            target=\"_blank\" class=\"_leandata-slack-integration-guide\">here</a>.</em>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n\n    <!-- Settings Config column (right) -->\n    <div class=\"settings-panel-section\">\n      <div class=\"ld-section-header settings-panel-header\">\n        {{ partnerLabel }} Settings\n      </div>\n      \n      <div class=\"settings-panel-content-wrapper\">\n        <div class=\"ld-body-large-bold settings-panel-auth-header\">Authorization</div>\n        <div class=\"ld-body-large-bold settings-panel-subheader\">Bot User OAuth Access Token</div>\n        <input\n          [(ngModel)]=\"integrationConfig.accessToken\"\n          (keyup)=\"handleAccessTokenInput($event)\"\n          class=\"ld-input-large large-token-input _access-token-input\"\n          placeholder=\"e.g.xoxb-23a3b4567c8de9f1ghi11jklmn121314o\"\n          [class.input-invalid]=\"tokenErrorMessage\"\n        />\n        <div *ngIf=\"tokenErrorMessage\" class=\"error-message token-error-message\">\n          {{ tokenErrorMessage }}\n        </div>\n      </div>\n\n      <div class=\"settings-panel-content-wrapper with-separator\" style=\"margin-bottom: 20px;\">\n        <div class=\"ld-body-large-bold field-mapping-header\">{{ partnerLabel }} Field Mapping</div>\n        <div class=\"integrations-field-mapping-header\">\n          <div class=\"header-cell header-cell-read\" [style.padding-left.px]=\"110\">Salesforce Field</div>\n          <div class=\"header-cell header-cell-write\" [style.padding-left.px]=\"80\">{{ partnerLabel }} Field</div>\n        </div>\n        <div *ngFor=\"let mappingField of mappingFields\" class=\"integrations-field-mapping-row\">\n          <div class=\"row-cell-read\">\n            <div class=\"ld-body-large-bold\">User Field</div>\n            <p-dropdown\n              [(ngModel)]=\"integrationConfig[mappingField.integrationConfigKey]\"\n              [options]=\"fieldDropdownOptions\"\n              placeholder=\"Select User Field\"\n              (onChange)=\"checkForChanges()\"\n              styleClass=\"ng-dropdown-large\"\n              class=\"read-cell-dropdown\"\n              dropdownIcon=\"down-arrow-icon\"\n            ></p-dropdown>\n          </div>\n          <div class=\"gray-arrow\"></div>\n          <div class=\"row-cell-write\" [style.padding-left.px]=\"10\">{{ partnerLabel }} Email</div>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n\n      <div class=\"settings-panel-content-wrapper with-separator ld-body-large\">\n        <p-checkbox \n          [(ngModel)]=\"integrationConfig.includePrivateChannel\" \n          (onChange)=\"toggleSlackChannelCheckbox($event)\" \n          styleClass=\"ng-checkbox-large _public-private-checkbox\" \n          label=\"Send {{ partnerName }} notifications to both public and private channels.\" \n          binary=\"true\"\n          [style.padding-left.px]=\"10\"\n        ></p-checkbox>\n      </div>\n\n      <div class=\"settings-panel-content-wrapper settings-buttons-wrapper\" [style.margin-top.px]=\"26\">\n        <div class=\"ld-primary-large-button\"\n          [class.disabled]=\"saveButtonDisabled()\"\n          (click)=\"saveConfigurationSettings()\">\n          {{ isAuthorized ? 'Update Settings' : 'Authorize ' + partnerLabel }}\n        </div>\n      </div>\n    </div>");

