/* harmony default export */ __webpack_exports__["default"] = ("<div id=\"usergems-wrapper\" class=\"angular-page-wrapper-props ld-body-medium\">\n  <ld-breadcrumbs [breadcrumbs]=\"breadcrumbs\"></ld-breadcrumbs>\n\n\n  <div class=\"ld-header\">Integrations</div>\n\n  <div class=\"partner-config-header-section with-separator\">\n    <div class=\"usergems-icon partner-icon-prop\"></div>\n    <div class=\"partner-config-header-description-wrapper ld-body-large\">\n      <div class=\"ld-subheader\">\n        {{ partnerLabel }}\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"ld-body-large\">\n        {{ summary }}\n      </div>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n  \n  <div class=\"partner-config-body-section\">\n    <div class=\"partner-instructions-section\">\n      <div class=\"ld-section-header get-started-header\">\n        Recommended for:\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"ld-body-large get-started-description extra-margin\">\n        <ul>\n          <li>UserGems Leads who are previous customers</li>\n          <li>UserGems Leads who are previous prospects in an open opportunity</li>\n          <li>New company matches your ICP</li>\n          <li>New job title matches your target Persona</li>\n        </ul>\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"ld-section-header instructions-header\">\n        Plays:\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"instruction-wrapper extra-margin\">\n        <div class=\"ld-body-large instructions-content\">\n          <ol>\n            <li>Auto-sequence past customers &amp; prospects in Sales Engagement tools</li>\n            <li>Automatically convert UserGems Leads to Contacts</li>\n          </ol>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"instruction-wrapper\">\n        <div class=\"ld-section-header instructions-subheader\">\n          Play #1\n        </div>\n        <div class=\"ld-section-header instructions-subheader\">Auto-sequence past customers &amp; prospects in Sales Engagement tools</div>\n        <div class=\"ld-body-large italic instructions-subheader\">\n          Implementation Steps [Lead and Contact Routing]\n        </div>\n        <div class=\"ld-body-large instructions-content\">\n          <ol>\n            <li>Ensure your UserGems data is set up to sync to Salesforce.</li>\n            <li>In LeanData Lead/Contact FlowBuilder, add the UserGems New Tracking Trigger to track job changes via UserGems.</li>\n            <ol type=\"a\">\n              <li>This can be done by using the pre-filled condition to only include records where the 'UG - Is a Past User' checkbox is set to true.</li>\n            </ol>\n            <li>Ensure the record is routed to the appropriate sales team member based on your sales strategy.</li>\n            <li>Connect the UserGems Trigger to a branch decision node to assess whether the Lead is a past customer or a past prospect.</li>\n            <li>Configure a tailored notification providing context to the assigned rep from Step #3 based on the results from Step #4.</li>\n            <li>Configure the Sales Engagement integrations (Outreach, Salesloft, Sales Engagement) that your organization leverages with the appropriate Sequence for past customers &amp; past prospects.</li>\n          </ol>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"instruction-wrapper\">\n        <div class=\"ld-section-header instructions-header\">\n          Play #2\n        </div>\n        <div class=\"ld-section-header instructions-subheader\">Automatically convert UserGems Leads to Contacts</div>\n        <div class=\"ld-body-large italic instructions-subheader\">\n          Implementation Steps [Lead Routing]\n        </div>\n        <div class=\"ld-body-large instructions-content\">\n          <ol>\n            <li>In UserGems, ensure your UserGems data is set up to sync to Salesforce. For more information, see <a href=\"https://www.usergems.com/products/contact-tracking\" target=\"_blank\">here</a>.</li>\n            <li>In LeanData Lead FlowBuilder, add the UserGems New Tracking Trigger to track job changes via UserGems.</li>\n            <ol type=\"a\">\n              <li>This can be done by usng the pre-filled condition to only include records where 'UG - Is a Past User' checkbox is set to true.</li>\n            </ol>\n            <li>Connect the UserGems Trigger to a Dupe Contact &amp; Dupe Lead Match and merge if a match is successfully found to enrich the original record with the new job data.</li>\n            <li>If no duplicate is found, match the UserGems Lead to an Account and auto-convert it.</li>\n            <li>If no existing Account match is found, automatically assess the UserGems Lead to see if it meets your ICP criteria via a Decision node.</li>\n            <ol type=\"a\">\n              <li>If yes, auto-create the Account and convert the Lead.</li>\n              <li>If not, route the lead to sales development with a notification on the recent job change.</li>\n            </ol>\n          </ol>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n</div>\n");

